# .railwayignore — controls what `railway up` uploads as the build context for
# the worker service. Keep only what Dockerfile.worker needs; exclude the rest
# so the upload is small and no local secrets leak.
#
# Dockerfile.worker builds a REDUCED Bun workspace (apps/worker/package.root-worker.json
# is copied as the root package.json), so apps/web and apps/extension are not needed.
# .git and node_modules are excluded by Railway automatically.

# Other apps (not part of the reduced worker workspace)
apps/web/
apps/extension/
apps/__tests__/

# Docs, specs, tooling and meta
docs/
spec/
.github/
.codegraph/
.openclaw/
.claude/
SOUL.md
*.md

# Local env files — never upload secrets
.env
.env.*

# Editor / OS junk
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
